00:31:51.601 --> 00:31:52.100
Mark.

00:31:52.100 --> 00:31:53.141
MARC CRANDALL: Hi, folks.

00:31:53.141 --> 00:31:54.190
Thanks for listening.

00:31:54.190 --> 00:31:56.620
So just because we talk
about collaboration

00:31:56.620 --> 00:32:00.310
in the cloud with regards to
legal professionals, lawyers,

00:32:00.310 --> 00:32:02.830
contract administrators
doesn't necessarily

00:32:02.830 --> 00:32:06.920
mean that you can or should put
